Lucide icons — curated subset
=============================

Source: https://unpkg.com/lucide-static@0.547.0/icons/<name>.svg
Upstream repository: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide (tag 0.547.0)
Version: lucide-static v0.547.0

Selected symbols (27):
menu, x, arrow-left, folder-plus, file-text, layout-grid, file-plus,
trash-2, list, network, tag, filter-x, check, arrow-up, arrow-down, pin,
pencil, chevron-down, chevron-left, chevron-right, zoom-in, zoom-out,
maximize, rotate-ccw, circle-check, circle-alert, triangle-alert

The sprite in ../icons.svg contains only these symbols. The upstream Lucide
LICENSE below is reproduced in full and covers the selected artwork, including
the portions of Lucide derived from Feather.

